  title "Messages Past the Seventeen"
  summary "Two underground dwellers, Cilocum and Otrolal, exchange encrypted letters discussing resource shortages, structural instability, and mysterious threats in their tunnel system. After an Accord meeting yields twelve fewer aurora-crystal crates than promised and veins at the sixth depth become exhausted, tensions rise as an unknown presence watches the lower patrol routes and ice-related geological changes accelerate. Nine months later, Otrolal's final letter suggests a transition of responsibility and hints at a dangerous threshold being crossed, with cryptic warnings about the cost of their survival."
